      en: ["The island is located within the Xiriualtique-Jiquilisco Biosphere Reserve.", "It is the home of Agustín 'Tin' Ruiz, a famous beach soccer star.", "The only access to the island is by boat from Puerto El Triunfo.", "The primary source of income for the residents is artisanal fishing.", "There are no paved roads or motor vehicles on the island.", "The mangroves surrounding the island are part of a protected Ramsar site."],
